   Auslander–Buchsbaum instance
   (`free_of_isRegular_of_ofList_eq_maximalIdeal`), the power-series
   stratum (`isNoetherianRing_mvPowerSeries`,
   `exists_isRegular_ofList_eq_maximalIdeal_mvPowerSeries`,
